FIRST INFORMATION REPORT (Section 173 BNSS)
District: Faridabad; Police Station: Sector 31; Year: 2026; FIR No: 219
Date and time of report: 19 September 2026 at 01:15 hrs
Acts and Sections: Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita 2023 - Sections 309(4), 3(5)
Place of occurrence: Near Badkhal Chowk, NH-19, Faridabad
Name of complainant: Harpreet Singh Gill, son of Jaspal Singh Gill, resident of House No. 88, Sector 21C, Faridabad. Tel. 9958 123 456.
Brief facts: On 18-09-2026 at about 11:40 PM, while the complainant was returning from his shop, three unknown persons on a Bajaj Pulsar (HR 51 AQ 3304) intercepted him, showed a country-made pistol and robbed Rs. 1,20,000 in cash and one gold chain. One of the miscreants was addressed as "Bunty" by the others. Passerby Mohd. Salim noted the number of the bike.
Investigating Officer: Sub-Inspector Naresh Yadav
